From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: airoha: describe AN7563 peripherals

Describe the AN7563 register layout, GPIO controller and Ethernet path.
Add board compatibles and retain the shared clock and SPI controller
fallbacks used by the existing drivers.

Signed-off-by: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
---
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/airoha,en7581-chip-scu.yaml
